# The quiver behind the right hip in the hero's melee dodges and on the ground (reports/archery/2026-11-05-quiver-rolls):
# a one-hander in hand at 1H talent 1 (HUMANS_1HST1), the bow and the quiver worn. Medium armour (ITAR_MIL_M): the roll
# four ways; heavy (ITAR_PAL_H): the slow roll four ways; light
# (ITAR_Leather_L): the dash forward and right. One dodge a clip, 0.5 s before and after; each writes its
# `melee dodge PC_HERO: ...` line after its `rec`. Then on the ground: sneaking in light leather and the fire mage's
# robe (ITAR_KDF_H), an npc bowman sitting down by a campfire, the hero knocked down for real (posture stun and a
# two-hander). Onar's field, open and level, 16:00; the hero faces 210, the sun in front on the right of the camera
# 2 m behind him on the right (on the ground: view full; the knockdown from above on his right side, 2.3 m from him).
# slowmo 4: a row of metrics.csv is 1/120 s of the game; rolls.py makes the clips (real time and 2x slower, 60 fps).
# Columns (graphics/mesh/quiver): qv_leg/qv_legt/qv_legl (the legs), qv_arm, qv_armor, qv_trunk (pelvis and spine
# points), qv_swing, qv_yield, qv_ax/ay/az (the axis); qv_gnd, qv_gndm, qv_gndt (cm the tube, its mouth, the tube from
# 16.75 cm down go under the world's collision), qv_botup (cm the bottom is over the ground), qv_gmode (1: the ground
# pushes it, 2: back from it), qv_gon (rays on), qv_clear (cm the tube's lowest point is over the ground), qv_rays,
# qv_rayus, qv_cpu (the step's CPU time on its thread), qv_need* (the least turn out of the ground, ignoring the body).
# TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1280x720 WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN BENCH_HOST=local
# OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<models of anim-strikes + meshes, materials of quiver>
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 16 0
release all
view clean
overlay off
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
wait 500
clear 3000
watch player
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
equip ITAR_MIL_M
arrows player 20
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
animinfo T_1HROLLB T_1HROLLL T_1HROLLR T_1HROLLF T_1HROLLHEAVYB T_1HROLLHEAVYL T_1HROLLHEAVYR T_1HROLLHEAVYF T_1HDASHF T_1HDASHR
cam look 95
cam follow 200 115 -135
slowmo 4
wait 2000
rec probe_frame
wait 200
stop

# --- medium: the roll
rec mil_roll_back
wait 500
dodge player back
wait 1520
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec mil_roll_left
wait 500
dodge player left
wait 1520
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec mil_roll_right
wait 500
dodge player right
wait 1520
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec mil_roll_forward
wait 500
dodge player forward
wait 1520
stop

# --- heavy: the slow roll
equip ITAR_PAL_H
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec pal_heavyroll_back
wait 500
dodge player back
wait 1880
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec pal_heavyroll_left
wait 500
dodge player left
wait 1880
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec pal_heavyroll_right
wait 500
dodge player right
wait 1880
stop
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
face 210
melee-shadow weapon 1h
stats 1h 45 talent 1
wait 2000
rec pal_heavyroll_forward
wait 500
dodge player forward
wait 1880
